dates go_functions_renamed v1
description "The same file as ../go_functions.cal, with the alias the note of its W001 gives; check says nothing, and every target takes it. Its own alias differs from the other file's only so that the two go through the targets side by side"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31

date net_30 = received
  + 30 days

date net30(net30_eom) = received
  close end of month
  + 30 days
